{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>&quot;Greyvale Rivalry&quot;</strong> the raunchy, hilarious, and outrageously sexy visual novel where college life is just a backdrop for booze, babes, and brutal sporting smackdowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever fantasized about the wild side of college? We're talking epic parties that spill out of dorm rooms and into the streets, the kind of shenanigans that make for legendary stories (and maybe a few regrettable photos), and the electric energy of fierce rivalries on and off the field. Greyvale Rivalry throws you headfirst into all of it, with you in the driver's seat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426460/extras/94d40c44336a3ed584867407f39b64eb.avif?t=1773643357\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Imagine landing a spot on the college soccer team, only to be hilariously mistaken for a hotshot football player and causin' the biggest clash of sports teams on campus since '99. That's your life now, rookie. Get ready for awkward encounters, cultural collisions between the finesse of soccer\u2014AKA football to the rest of the world\u2014and the brute force of American football, and a social scene that's as cutthroat as it is tempting. You'll be navigating friendships, forging your identity, and trying to keep your head above the tide of non-stop parties, panties, and hormone-fueled drama.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426460/extras/8eef765be11969e2b093d44f0f3c7e22.avif?t=1773643357\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/34264